{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Backyard Digger is a relaxing game about digging in your backyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover what lies beneath your lawn \u2014 it might be more than just dirt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mine valuable metals, uncover hidden treasures, and stumble upon abandoned mines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell everything you find and upgrade your tools to dig deeper and more efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avoid dangers like falling rocks, extreme heat, and the risk of crashing as you descend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reach the very bottom and uncover the unknown secrets hidden in Backyard Digger!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3264640?t=1744739000","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3264640?t=1744739000","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/135682f1559fb61fa9287d42950265202858e7f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744739000","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/135682f1559fb61fa9287d42950265202858e7f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744739000","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>PLEASE WISHLIST THE GAME AND FOLLOW TO SUPPORT US</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/extras/Steam_wishlist_en.gif?t=1744739000\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Backyard Digger is a relaxing game about digging in your backyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover what lies beneath your lawn \u2014 it might be more than just dirt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mine valuable metals, uncover hidden treasures, and stumble upon abandoned mines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell everything you find and upgrade your tools to dig deeper and more efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avoid dangers like falling rocks, extreme heat, and the risk of crashing as you descend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reach the very bottom and uncover the unknown secrets hidden in Backyard Digger!</p>","developers":["Milord"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/07d214c7d990ee037b4c5459bdf4ada5e83f9669/header.jpg?t=1744739000","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Backyard Digger","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 7400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia gtx 1060 3gb<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Milord"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Q2 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/189e956b4105a1ec811972a1951df7b931d3487c/ss_189e956b4105a1ec811972a1951df7b931d3487c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744739000","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/189e956b4105a1ec811972a1951df7b931d3487c/ss_189e956b4105a1ec811972a1951df7b931d3487c.600x338.jpg?t=1744739000"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/a34361c19ac030cba6f7f6598e2b